<title>USA: America West March load factor 75.4.</title>
<headline>America West March load factor 75.4.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>America West Airlines Tuesday reported record March 1997 traffic at 1.5 billion revenue passenger miles (RPMs), up 13.0 percent over the same month last year.</p>
<p>Capacity increased 15.8 percent to a record 2.0 billion available seat miles (ASMs) resulting in a passenger load factor of 75.4 percent versus 77.3 percent in March 1996.  </p>
<p>America West also reported first quarter 1997 traffic at a record 4.0 billion RPMs, up 13.4 percent over first quarter 1996. First quarter ASMs increased 16.9 percent over 1996 first quarter to 5.8 billion,  resulting in a year-to-date passenger load factor of 68.6 percent versus 70.7 percent in 1996.  </p>
<p>The following summarizes America West's March and first quarter traffic results for 1997 and 1996:</p>
