<p>		1,516,674	   1,342,392		 13.0</p>
<p>Available Seat</p>
<p>Miles (000)</p>
<p>		2,011,247	   1,736,883		 15.8</p>
<p>Load Factor (percent)</p>
<p>		  75.4		  77.3     (1.9) points</p>
